  "worked_solution": "The second-order Cauchy\u2013Euler equation has the form\n\n$$\na{x}^{2}y\u2032\u2032+bxy\u2032+cy=f(x),\n$$\n\nwhere $a,b,$ and $c$ are constants.\n\nOf the given equations, the only equation that has the above form is\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}{y}^{\u2033}+2x{y}^{\u2032}+4y=\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}}.\n$$",
